usage: compliproof [-h] {reconcile,report,audit,users} ...

CompliProof — prototype local reconciliation and evidence-pack tool

positional arguments:
  {reconcile,report,audit,users}
    reconcile           Reconcile two CSV files
    report              Generate HTML reconciliation report for a task
                        (prototype)
    audit               Audit log operations
    users               Provision local user accounts

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
